# Repository-wide line ending policy.
#
# The tree is developed on Windows and deployed on Linux, and the CDN ships
# third-party builds byte-for-byte. Normalize text to LF in the repository so
# a checkout never turns into a 10k-line "changed file" diff, and mark real
# binaries so git never rewrites them.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.eot binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.rar binary
*.apk binary
*.exe binary
*.pdf binary
